<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wendy's cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wendy's cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney analyst Stacy Jamar on Thursday reduced her rating on fast-food chain Wendy's International Inc to neutral from outperform, her office confirmed.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment. No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- Wendy's shares were off 2-5/8 at 24-5/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
